ategories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","review_id":"TLjtt9uDT_3JJfro4Rp1Pg","date":"2019-04-11T08:09:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9429575204849243,"text_excerpt":"We wanted something close to the hotel tonight so we stopped by Willie's Chicken Shack - we both ordered chicken tenders w/ fries. For some reason our order took forever to come out (about 4 people ordered after us received food first) but no big deal we're in NOLA and it's busy I understand. Once we got the food I asked for sauces on the side, we got ranch, honey mustard and the secret sauce - all were great! I will be coming back here when I'm back in town. Great spot on Canal."},{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","review_id":"cjbpL_0W_kSXtC1eRuCjuA","date":"2018-04-08T15:33:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9426655769348145,"text_excerpt":"I made my first ever stop at a Willie's Chicken Shack and let me say, it absolutely blew me away. I came here around noon yesterday and it was absolutely packed (for good reason). I spent about 20 mins in line to order (which is absolutely not a problem) and when the time finally came, I ordered some fried chicken with some French fries on the side (side note, the cashier was super friendly). How was the fried chicken? Well, I think the word to describe it would be \"GLORIOUS\". The chicken was so juicy, hot, tender, and was absolutely amazing. I swear, which each bite the chicken got even better. On top having amazing chicken, the fries were also delicious! Overall, this is definitely I pl..."},{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","review_id":"V42DOJGBkT09-CTFSiyiMA","date":"2019-11-17T19:04:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356253147125244,"text_excerpt":"First time in #NOLA and the perfect way to kick it off. When you enter the establishment it's such a great vibe. Really good southern hospitality and some bomb ass fried chicken. Met me a new friend too, Damonishaa. She exemplified great customer service. Everyone working in the establishment was really friendly overall. Now let's talk about this chicken ; it was freshly prepared and well seasoned. Added some bbq and hot sauce let's just say heaven. The biscuit mouth watering ; definitely didn't need a sip of water after. To top it off , there's frozen drinks and trap music such a vibe. I love trap music. Wish we had a Willie's in New York. Everyone should definitely visit."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","photo_id":"Zn6qdmH_gEsAHdsRTeVIWw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Zn6qdmH_gEsAHdsRTeVIWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8638683557510376},{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","photo_id":"kAde11FjQBLCCA5wlV6aQw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kAde11FjQBLCCA5wlV6aQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8147746324539185},{"business_id":"g10CUV0LY50kLHMn5wgS_g","photo_id":"2VBTH3MnWa7bFTnbHuPS4g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2VBTH3MnWa7bFTnbHuPS4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8088632822036743}]},"notebook_case":null}
